{
  "name": "Banishing Shot",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You use abjuration magic to try to temporarily banish your target to a harmless demiplane. The creature hit by the projectile takes D6 x Proficiency extra force damage and must succeed on a Charisma Saving Throw or be banished. While banished in this way, the target is Incapacitated. At the end of its next turn, the target reappears in the space it vacated or in the nearest unoccupied space if that space is occupied.</p>",
